{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soldiers vs Zombies is a tower defense game where zombies have overrun the world, and humanity\u2019s last hope lies in elite soldiers. Armed from laser rifles to death machine guns, you\u2019ll deploy troops and use special skills to stop waves of mutated zombies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/BT_Text_Steam_MAIM_EN_green.png?t=1742245991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/70a9f90b1263f164ce4e1006df29b720.gif?t=1742245991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Soldiers vs Zombies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soldiers vs Zombies is a fast-paced tower defense game set in a world overrun by zombies. Command elite soldiers armed with powerful weapons like laser rifles and the death machine gun to stop waves of mutated zombies. Each soldier has unique abilities, and you can upgrade their stats to face increasingly tough challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/BT_Text_Steam_BLAST_EN_green.png?t=1742245991\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307010/extras/65df08a9521c9cab5f32129eda35e20e.gif?t=1742245991\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 40 levels, diverse zombie types, and a variety of skills at your disposal, you'll need to think strategically to survive. Use your soldiers' abilities and powerful weapons to prevent humanity\u2019s extinction in this action-packed and tactical defense experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307010?t=1